    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragon March is a modern and challenging spin on the classic game of Snake. Guide Cereal, The Metal Dragon, through levels full of obstacles while rescuing other Metal Dragons along your path. As your line increases, so does the danger. Bumping into almost anything causes a game over. Reach the exit and you win the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617120/extras/b07e3f07b023c3860582622f1d7e0d15.poster.avif?t=1750227597\" width=402 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617120/extras/b07e3f07b023c3860582622f1d7e0d15.webm?t=1750227597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617120/extras/b07e3f07b023c3860582622f1d7e0d15.mp4?t=1750227597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After feeling something he had never felt before, Cereal wakes up and decides to escape the computer he is trapped inside of and take his friends along. Digital creatures such as viruses, literal bugs, and anti-virus operators will stand in his way but with LOVE anything is possible! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617120/extras/eceb2f6593a3c39ef5b34a00af538d30.poster.avif?t=1750227597\" width=402 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617120/extras/eceb2f6593a3c39ef5b34a00af538d30.webm?t=1750227597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617120/extras/eceb2f6593a3c39ef5b34a00af538d30.mp4?t=1750227597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple tank controls. Easy to use but hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 3 worlds of challenging stages. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many viewable collectibles that expand the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2000s inspired style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delightful music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute robot dragon guys!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragon March is a modern and challenging spin on the classic game of Snake. Guide Cereal, The Metal Dragon, through levels full of obstacles while rescuing other Metal Dragons along your path. As your line increases, so does the danger. Bumping into almost anything causes a game over. Reach the exit and you win the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617120/extras/b07e3f07b023c3860582622f1d7e0d15.poster.avif?t=1750227597\" width=402 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617120/extras/b07e3f07b023c3860582622f1d7e0d15.webm?t=1750227597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617120/extras/b07e3f07b023c3860582622f1d7e0d15.mp4?t=1750227597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After feeling something he had never felt before, Cereal wakes up and decides to escape the computer he is trapped inside of and take his friends along. Digital creatures such as viruses, literal bugs, and anti-virus operators will stand in his way but with LOVE anything is possible! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617120/extras/eceb2f6593a3c39ef5b34a00af538d30.poster.avif?t=1750227597\" width=402 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617120/extras/eceb2f6593a3c39ef5b34a00af538d30.webm?t=1750227597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617120/extras/eceb2f6593a3c39ef5b34a00af538d30.mp4?t=1750227597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple tank controls. Easy to use but hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 3 worlds of challenging stages. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many viewable collectibles that expand the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2000s inspired style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delightful music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute robot dragon guys!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced action game like Snake where you traverse levels full of obstacles. You don't stop running forward, so steer to safety and rescue your Metal Dragon friends, but be careful, everything makes you trip!",
